      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://discoverdenali.org/cantwell/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Before settlers, the area was inhabited only by nomadic Ahtna Athabaskans who hunted and fished.",
