        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cantwell%2C_Alaska"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Ahtna people refer to Cantwell as 'Yedatene'na', reflecting their deep cultural ties.",
